      <string>The bands are stored as ESA delivers them, in digital numbers. Since processing baseline 04.00 (January 2022, N0400 and later in the name), reflectance = (DN - 1000) / 10000; before it, DN / 10000. In SCL, 3 is cloud shadow, 8 to 10 clouds and cirrus, 11 snow.</string>
     </property>
